     "call": 7,
     "path": "result.bodies.0.volume",
     "equals": 24000.0
    }
   ],
   "note": "Frozen, the pad keeps its shape though Length is 25 (24000 mm³); thawed and recomputed it is 30000; then back to 20. If call 1 is refused because the frozen pad reads as failed, note FreeCAD's words: that is the doubtful point in the findings."
  },
